  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum 模組。用心打造。為 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 提供大量活躍的模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"關於此模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Ore Harvester 允許玩家蹲下時破壞其中的任何一個方塊，即可瞬間開採整條礦脈。開採時間會根據礦脈中的礦物數量而增加。所有掉落的礦物都會出現在最初被破壞的方塊位置。它與絲綢之觸及其他附魔相容。只要視線不受阻擋（透過空氣方塊），連接的對角線方塊也會被破壞。<br><br>本模組提供多種設定選項以調整行為。此外還有一個黑名單檔案，您可以指定哪些鎬子可以使用此功能。<br><br>此模組是為配合我的 <a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tree-harvester\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tree Harvester</a> 模組而開發。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"相依模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"收錄於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-qol-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/qol-bundle.svg\" alt=\"收錄於 Serilum&#x27;s QoL Bundle\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"運行環境：伺服器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可設定項目\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的設定選項：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>oreHarvestWithoutSneak</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若啟用，則在不按住蹲下鍵時即可開採礦物。若停用則相反，僅在蹲下時生效。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>dropOresAtFirstBrokenBlock</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否將開採礦脈中的所有礦物掉落物集中於第一個被破壞的方塊位置。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableFuzzyOreSearch</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">啟用模糊搜尋後，將使用方塊的原始名稱來判斷其是否為礦物方塊。這能提升與未設定方塊標籤的其他模組的相容性，但會略微增加誤判的機率。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>loseDurabilityPerHarvestedOre</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若啟用，每開採一單位礦物，手持的鎬子將消耗耐久度。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>loseDurabilityModifier</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：1.0，最小值：0.001，最大值：1.0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">您可在此設定開採一條礦脈時鎬子應消耗的耐久度比例。例如設為 0.1，代表每開採 10 個礦物消耗 1 點耐久度。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>increaseExhaustionPerHarvestedOre</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若啟用，玩家每次開採礦物將增加 0.005 的疲勞值（Minecraft 預設值為每破壞一個方塊 0.005）* increaseExhaustionModifier。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>increaseExhaustionModifier</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：1.0，最小值：0.001，最大值：1.0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">此設定決定每開採一個礦物玩家應增加的疲勞值。預設為 0.005 * 1.0。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>increaseHarvestingTimePerOre</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若啟用，開採時間將隨著礦脈中存在的礦物數量而增加。增加幅度由 'increasedHarvestingTimePerOreModifier' 決定。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>increasedHarvestingTimePerOreModifier</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：0.2，最小值：0.01，最大值：10.0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">當啟用 'increaseHarvestingTimePerOre' 時，開採一條礦脈所需時間的增加程度。實際速度計算公式為：newSpeed = originalSpeed / (1 + (logCount * increasedHarvestingTimePerOreModifier))。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><br><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>鎬子黑名單功能：</strong></span><br>僅允許特定的鎬子開採礦脈。首次載入模組時會生成一個黑名單檔案。該檔案位於 <strong><em>./config/oreharvester/harvestable_pickaxe_blacklist.txt</em></strong>。此功能同樣適用於模組添加的鎬子物品。<br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/ore-harvester/a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"994\" height=\"622\"></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">只要在礦脈中開採任意一種礦物，其中的所有方塊都會被破壞：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/ore-harvester/b.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">與絲綢之觸及其他任何附魔相容：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/ore-harvester/c.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>您可在任何整合包中自由使用此模組，前提是下載來源必須保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有可用模組的總覽與更多資訊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由於我無法在這麼多獨立的模組頁面中追蹤評論，因此已關閉評論功能。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如有問題、想法、建議或其他事項，歡迎前往&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 儲存庫</a>。感謝！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
